---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import J from '../../components/J.astro';
export { paths as getStaticPaths } from '../../data/paths';
const { lang } = Astro.params; const ja = lang==='ja';
---
<Base lang={lang} page="about" title={ja?'わたしについて':'About'}>
<h1>{ja?'わたしについて':'About'}</h1>
{ja ? <>
<J en="I grew up in a military family, so we moved around India often. Each time, I learned to adapt to a new place.">軍人の家族で育ったので、インドの中で何度も引っこしました。そのたびに、新しい場所になれることを学びました。</J>
<J en="I speak Hindi, Bengali, Odia and English. I am learning Japanese, and I have talked with Japanese friends on HelloTalk since 2024.">ヒンディー語、ベンガル語、オディア語、英語を話します。日本語をべんきょう中で、2024年からHelloTalkで日本の友だちと話しています。</J>
<J en="My first tech job was making games. Then I moved into AI. Since June 2024, I have worked remotely on AI evaluation and safety.">さいしょの仕事はゲーム作りでした。そのあとAIの仕事にうつりました。2024年6月から、リモートでAIの評価と安全性の仕事をしています。</J>
</> : <>
<p>I grew up in a military family that moved around India, so adapting to new places became normal.</p>
<p>I speak Hindi, Bengali, Odia and English, and I'm learning Japanese (HelloTalk conversations since March 2024).</p>
<p>Game development was my way into tech: at GodSpeed Games (2022–2023) I worked on "Bunny Park" for Xbox, PS4 and PC in Unreal Engine and C++. I always followed ML and moved fully into AI. Since June 2024 I've worked remotely as an AI Engineer (contract) on LLM evaluation, safety/red-teaming and multimodal work, with teams across Europe.</p>
<p>B.Tech in Computer Science & Engineering (Honours), GIFT Bhubaneswar, 2021.</p>
</>}
</Base>
